WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.400
better-scf: a review layer for the Stellar Community Fund.

00:01.400 --> 00:05.600
Keep a private shortlist. Mark your stance, star it and add notes only you can see.

00:05.600 --> 00:10.200
Search a round and filter by track and by your own marks.

00:10.200 --> 00:17.700
